# PHP Learning Roadmap

## Goal

Learn PHP fundamentals required to understand and build Laravel APIs.

---

# Phase 1 — PHP Basics

- [x] Understand PHP syntax
- [x] Run a PHP file
- [x] Hello World
- [x] Variables
- [x] Constants
- [x] Comments

## Types

- [x] Strings
- [x] Integers
- [x] Floats
- [x] Booleans
- [x] Null
- [x] Type juggling

## Operators

- [x] Arithmetic operators
- [x] Assignment operators
- [x] Comparison operators
- [x] Logical operators

## Control Flow

- [x] if
- [x] switch
- [x] match
- [x] loops

